ecm_add_qml_module() is called here before anything includes ECMQmlModule
(PlasmaMacros.cmake includes it only inside plasma_add_applet()), so configuring
fails with "Unknown CMake command ecm_add_qml_module". Include it in this directory
only: ECMQmlModule sets QTP0001 to NEW for the including directory, which would move
the qrc prefix of the other qt_add_qml_module() targets (initialstart loads
qrc:org/kde/plasma/mobileinitialstart/... by path).

--- a/components/waydroidintegrationplugin/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/components/waydroidintegrationplugin/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@
 # SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2025 Florian RICHER <florian.richer@protonmail.com>
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
+include(ECMQmlModule)
+
 
 set(waydroidintegrationplugin_SRCS
     waydroidapplicationdbusobject.cpp
